  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is continuous,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is continuous,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mfenced></math> has to be equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>..</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>..</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>For limit to exist <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and limit is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>v</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Using, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced><mi>v</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Checking differentiability at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>..</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>:</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Function is differentiable at every point in its domain</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
